    {
      "executionState" : "enabled",
      "id" : "note",
      "kind" : "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters" : {
        "text" : "# Ashen Path · Generated 3D textures\nOn each Run, three fixed-seed SDXS 512 jobs generate rocky earth, bridge decking, and cliff sides. Asset Cache stores the three generated images as named slots for this run. Its card previews each texture as it becomes ready. The game starts after all three are ready; later frames reuse the bundle without invoking SDXS again. Cancel and Run starts a fresh cache and regenerates all three. The model package remains link-only.\n\nThe larger continuous wilderness has no walkable cell outlines. Dense woods and boulder fields are impassable; follow the open ground around them. Click a revealed place in the Trackpad to walk; use Action or Space near the creature. Collect all seven coins and defeat the creature to light the portal."
      },
      "resources" : {

      },
      "title" : "How to play"
    },
